		<strong>DevOps:</strong> Docker, Kubernetes, Ansible, Prometheus, Grafana<br />
		<strong>Security &amp; Networking:</strong> Patch &amp; vulnerability management, OS hardening, malware
		analysis, SOC Tier 1, LPIC-1, Network+, Security+
